url: "https://bethspornitz.github.io/nlp-03-text-exploration-custom/"
license: MIT

abstract: |
  A custom exploratory natural language processing project
  comparing vocabulary and language patterns across Data Analyst,
  Business Analyst, and Data Governance job descriptions.
  The analysis examines token frequencies, category differences,
  word co-occurrence, and bigrams to identify common terminology
  and multiword skill phrases.

